      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990-EZ, PART III</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THIS NONPROFIT ORGANIZATION PRODUCES A VARIETY OF PROGRAMS TO AIMED AT PROMOTING EDUCATION, SOCIAL AWARENESS, POSITIVE SELF-ESTEEM, LITERACY AND GENUINE GOODWILL. THIS EFFORTS ARE DIRECTED TOWARDS IMPROVING THE QUALITY OF LIFE FOR CHILDREN, FAMILIES, AND COMMUNITIES. THE FOUNDATION ADMINISTRES AND FUNDS A SCHOOLARSHIP PROGRAM FOR GRADUATING HIGH SCHOOL STUDENTS PLANNING TO ATTEND FOUR YEAR UNIVESSITIES, COMMUNITY COLLEGES OR VOCATIONAL TRAINNING CENTERS AFTER GRADUATION. ITS PURPOSE IS TO ASSIST DESERVING STUDENTS WITH THEIR EDUCATIONAL AND OCCUPATIONAL ENDEAVORS. THE ORGANIZATION CONDUCTED A THANKSGIVING AND CHRISTMAS PROGRAM WHEREIN IT DISTRIBUTED DINNERS AND TOYS TO NEEDY FAMILIES. THE FAMILIES WERE PRESELECTED THROUGH ORGANIZATIONS THAT ASSIST THE HOMELESS, ELDERLY, LOW-INCOME INDIVIDUALS AND CHURCH ASSISTANCE PROGRAMS. OTHER MISCELLANEOUS PROGRAM EXPENSES.</ExplanationTxt>
